# The one thing the Deploy button asks for. On your laptop, copy this file to .dev.vars and fill it in.
# Never commit .dev.vars. Never put secrets in wrangler.jsonc.

# The password for your store's admin. Make up something long; a password manager's suggestion is ideal.
# You type it once per phone or laptop to sign in at /admin. Everything else (your Stripe key, your
# contact email, your products) is entered in the admin itself.
ADMIN_KEY=

# Optional, for a laptop: a Stripe key here saves pasting it in the admin while you work locally.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
